# Research (docs/re-field-hud.md): do the bottom-screen edges walk Jian? (needs hud_d0)
load hud_d0
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x0
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y0
touch 4 96 40
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x_after_left_edge
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y_after_left_edge
touch 250 96 40
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x_after_right_edge
touch 128 4 40
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y_after_top_edge
touch 128 188 40
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y_after_bottom_edge
touch 73 54 3
wait 20
peek u32 0x020AFF84 dummy
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x_after_watch_tap
